{"seq":1,"slug":"cross-system-delete-cascade","title":"跨系统删除级联编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/data-subject-rights-fulfillment/cascade-delete-anonymize/cross-system-delete-cascade","wordCount":1925,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨系统删除级联编排\">跨系统删除级联编排</h1><p>删除清单确定之后，平台要把它变成一次跨几十个异构系统的分布式编排。关系库里的行、对象存储里的对象、搜索索引里的文档、KV 缓存里的键、消息队列里的事件、数仓里的分区、第三方服务商侧的副本——每一个的删除语义都不同，每一个都可能失败，而合起来必须构成一个能被举证的完整结果。这一节讲的是如何用执行器抽象、状态机、幂等契约与对账机制，把一盘散沙收敛到确定的终态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>最朴素的想象是「发一个删除事件，各系统自己删」。这个方案在第一次遇到部分失败时就会崩塌：某个系统超时了，你不知道它到底删了没有；重试可能导致重复删除或误删；某个系统说删失败但没告诉你原因；几天后你发现有一个系统根本没订阅到这条消息。要解决这些问题，删除必须是<strong>有状态、可重放、可对账</strong>的编排，而不是一次性的消息广播。</p>\n<p>第二个关键认识是：删除<strong>不应该做成分布式事务</strong>。两阶段提交（2PC）要求所有参与方支持准备/提交协议，而对象存储、搜索索引、消息队列这些系统做不到，即使做得到，长事务持锁也会拖垮在线业务。正确的取舍是<strong>可对账的最终一致</strong>：每个系统独立执行、独立报告，平台通过一个持久的状态机跟踪进度，通过周期性的对账扫描找出偏差并补偿。代价是删除不是瞬时完成的，收益是它可以真正完成。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[Planned&lt;br/&gt;生成执行器任务] --&gt; B[Dispatched&lt;br/&gt;执行器领取]&#10;  B --&gt; C[Executing&lt;br/&gt;执行中]&#10;  C --&gt;|回执 OK| D[Succeeded]&#10;  C --&gt;|回执失败或超时| E[Failed]&#10;  E --&gt;|幂等重试| C&#10;  E --&gt;|超过重试上限| F[Escalated]&#10;  D --&gt; G[Verified&lt;br/&gt;复核确认]&#10;  G --&gt; H[终态: 已完成]&#10;  F --&gt; I[ManualReview]&#10;  I --&gt;|人工介入后重放| C&#10;  I --&gt;|时间不足| J[Excepted&lt;br/&gt;转例外处理]\">flowchart TD\n  A[Planned&lt;br/&gt;生成执行器任务] --&gt; B[Dispatched&lt;br/&gt;执行器领取]\n  B --&gt; C[Executing&lt;br/&gt;执行中]\n  C --&gt;|回执 OK| D[Succeeded]\n  C --&gt;|回执失败或超时| E[Failed]\n  E --&gt;|幂等重试| C\n  E --&gt;|超过重试上限| F[Escalated]\n  D --&gt; G[Verified&lt;br/&gt;复核确认]\n  G --&gt; H[终态: 已完成]\n  F --&gt; I[ManualReview]\n  I --&gt;|人工介入后重放| C\n  I --&gt;|时间不足| J[Excepted&lt;br/&gt;转例外处理]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参与方类型</th>\n<th>删除语义</th>\n<th>典型失败模式</th>\n<th>幂等依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>关系库</td>\n<td><code>DELETE</code> 行（逻辑删除字节仍存）</td>\n<td>长事务、外键约束阻塞</td>\n<td>主体键 + 唯一索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象存储</td>\n<td>删除对象/版本</td>\n<td>WORM 对象拒绝删除</td>\n<td>对象键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索索引</td>\n<td>删除文档</td>\n<td>索引分片副本不同步</td>\n<td>文档 ID</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KV 缓存</td>\n<td>删除键</td>\n<td>键已过期（删除结果不确定）</td>\n<td>键 + 期望值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息队列</td>\n<td>写墓碑（null 值）</td>\n<td>墓碑本身被保留策略清除</td>\n<td>消息键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数仓</td>\n<td>分区替换/写覆盖</td>\n<td>历史分区不可变</td>\n<td>分区 + 主体分片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三方 SaaS</td>\n<td>调 API 或提工单</td>\n<td>无删除 API，需人工</td>\n<td>供应商侧主体 ID</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"执行器抽象\">执行器抽象</h3><p>把「删除」抽象成一个执行器接口，是让编排可扩展的起点。每个系统实现一个执行器，平台只认识接口。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DeletionExecutor {&#10;  key: string;&#10;  supports: (&#39;erase&#39; | &#39;anonymize&#39; | &#39;freeze&#39;)[];&#10;  idempotencyKey(task: DeleteTask): string;&#10;  execute(task: DeleteTask): Promise&lt;ExecutionReceipt&gt;;&#10;  verify(task: DeleteTask): Promise&lt;VerificationResult&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;type ExecutionReceipt = {&#10;  taskId: string;&#10;  systemKey: string;&#10;  outcome: &#39;deleted&#39; | &#39;anonymized&#39; | &#39;frozen&#39; | &#39;not_found&#39; | &#39;refused&#39;;&#10;  affectedRows?: number;&#10;  evidenceRef?: string;&#10;  refusalCode?: string;&#10;  executedAt: string;&#10;};&#10;&#10;type VerificationResult = {&#10;  taskId: string;&#10;  stillPresent: boolean;&#10;  checkedVia: &#39;read_back&#39; | &#39;count_probe&#39; | &#39;index_lookup&#39;;&#10;  checkedAt: string;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DeletionExecutor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  supports</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'erase'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'anonymize'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'freeze'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  idempotencyKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">task</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DeleteTask</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  execute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">task</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DeleteTask</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ExecutionReceipt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  verify</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">task</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DeleteTask</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">VerificationResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ExecutionReceipt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  taskId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  systemKey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  outcome</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'deleted'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'anonymized'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'frozen'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'not_found'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'refused'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  affectedRows</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  evidenceRef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  refusalCode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  executedAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VerificationResult</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  taskId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  stillPresent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  checkedVia</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'read_back'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'count_probe'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'index_lookup'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  checkedAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>接口里两个设计决定值得说明。<code>outcome</code> 包含 <code>not_found</code>——主体在该系统中无数据是一个<strong>成功</strong>结果而非失败，混淆两者会让完成率统计失真。<code>verify</code> 是独立方法而非 <code>execute</code> 的附带返回值，因为「我删了」与「我确认现在查不到了」是两个不同强度的断言，前者是执行者的自述，后者是平台的复核；在<a href=\"../dsr-sla-audit/dsr-evidence-request-log\">审计举证</a>中，复核远比自述有说服力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"幂等键的构造\">幂等键的构造</h3><p>幂等是重试的前提。删除的幂等键必须同时满足「同一次删除的多次重试得到相同键」与「不同语义的删除得到不同键」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"idempotency_key = sha256( subject_ref&#10;                        + &quot;:&quot; + system_key&#10;                        + &quot;:&quot; + entity_scope_hash&#10;                        + &quot;:&quot; + request_id )&#10;&#10;# entity_scope_hash 由删除范围决定：&#10;#   全主体删除        -&gt; &quot;ALL&quot;&#10;#   按时间窗删除      -&gt; sha256(&quot;window:&quot; + from + &quot;..&quot; + to)&#10;#   按实体集合删除    -&gt; sha256(&quot;entities:&quot; + sorted(entity_list).join(&quot;,&quot;))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>idempotency_key = sha256( subject_ref</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        + \":\" + system_key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        + \":\" + entity_scope_hash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        + \":\" + request_id )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># entity_scope_hash 由删除范围决定：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#   全主体删除        -> \"ALL\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#   按时间窗删除      -> sha256(\"window:\" + from + \"..\" + to)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#   按实体集合删除    -> sha256(\"entities:\" + sorted(entity_list).join(\",\"))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>把 <code>entity_scope_hash</code> 纳入是有原因的：同一个人可能因两次不同请求产生两个不同范围的删除任务（第一次删全部，第二次只删某类数据），如果把键只做成 <code>subject + system</code>，第二个任务会被误判为重复而跳过。另一方面，<code>request_id</code> 纳入键则保证跨请求不串扰。键写进执行器的持久表并加唯一约束，重复执行由数据库而非应用逻辑兜住。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编排的持久化模型\">编排的持久化模型</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE dsr_delete_task (&#10;  task_id         TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  request_id      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  subject_ref     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  system_key      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  action          TEXT NOT NULL,          -- erase | anonymize | freeze&#10;  entity_scope    JSONB NOT NULL,&#10;  idempotency_key TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,&#10;  state           TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;planned&#39;,&#10;  attempt         INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  max_attempts    INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 8,&#10;  next_attempt_at TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  receipt         JSONB,&#10;  last_error      TEXT,&#10;  created_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  updated_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_delete_task_due&#10;  ON dsr_delete_task (next_attempt_at)&#10;  WHERE state IN (&#39;planned&#39;,&#39;failed&#39;);&#10;&#10;-- 领取待执行任务（跳过锁等待，避免编排器互相阻塞）&#10;UPDATE dsr_delete_task t&#10;SET state = &#39;executing&#39;, attempt = attempt + 1, updated_at = now()&#10;WHERE t.task_id = (&#10;  SELECT task_id FROM dsr_delete_task&#10;  WHERE state IN (&#39;planned&#39;,&#39;failed&#39;) AND next_attempt_at &lt;= now()&#10;  ORDER BY next_attempt_at&#10;  FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED&#10;  LIMIT 1&#10;)&#10;RETURNING *;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dsr_delete_task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  task_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  request_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  subject_ref     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  system_key      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- erase | anonymize | freeze</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity_scope    JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idempotency_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'planned'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  attempt         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  max_attempts    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  next_attempt_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  receipt         JSONB,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  last_error      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updated_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_delete_task_due</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dsr_delete_task (next_attempt_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'planned'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'failed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 领取待执行任务（跳过锁等待，避免编排器互相阻塞）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dsr_delete_task t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'executing'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, attempt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> attempt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">task_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dsr_delete_task</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'planned'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'failed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next_attempt_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next_attempt_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FOR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> SKIP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> LOCKED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED</code> 让多个编排器实例可以安全并发领取任务而不互相等待——这是把「编排器」做成可水平扩展服务的关键一行。<code>state</code> 的非终态集合（<code>planned</code>/<code>dispatched</code>/<code>executing</code>/<code>failed</code>）与终态集合（<code>succeeded</code>/<code>excepted</code>/<code>escalated</code>）必须在代码里有明确的分界，因为<strong>超时判定只能作用于非终态</strong>：一个已经成功的任务不应因为复核慢而被重新调度。</p>\n<p>这套状态集合同样适合对齐 W3C DPV 定义的行权请求状态机（<code>RequestInitiated</code> → <code>RequestAcknowledged</code> → <code>RequestAccepted</code> / <code>RequestRequiresAction</code> → <code>RequestFulfilled</code> / <code>RequestUnfulfilled</code>，另有 <code>RequestActionDelayed</code> 表示延期）（<a href=\"https://w3c-cg.github.io/dpv/2.0/dpv/\">W3C DPV 2.0，2024-08-01</a>）。对齐的好处不在术语本身，而在它对「延期」与「待补充动作」给出了独立状态，避免了把这两类中间态硬塞进「进行中」而丢失预警能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"部分失败的处理策略\">部分失败的处理策略</h2><p>部分失败是常态而非异常，策略必须分类而非一刀切。</p>\n<h3 id=\"可重试与不可重试\">可重试与不可重试</h3><p>按失败原因分档，而不是按系统分档。<strong>可重试</strong>：网络超时、下游限流、下游短暂不可用、死锁。<strong>不可重试</strong>：下游明确拒绝（如 WORM 对象拒绝删除）、权限不足、schema 不兼容、主体在系统中根本不存在（这其实是成功）。给每个 <code>refusalCode</code> 配置一个策略，避免无脑重试把下游打挂：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;retry_policy&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;base_delay_ms&quot;: 500,&#10;    &quot;factor&quot;: 2.0,&#10;    &quot;max_delay_ms&quot;: 3600000,&#10;    &quot;jitter&quot;: &quot;full&quot;,&#10;    &quot;max_attempts&quot;: 8,&#10;    &quot;non_retryable_codes&quot;: [&#10;      &quot;WORM_OBJECT_PROTECTED&quot;,&#10;      &quot;LEGAL_HOLD_ACTIVE&quot;,&#10;      &quot;PERMISSION_DENIED&quot;,&#10;      &quot;SCHEMA_MISMATCH&quot;,&#10;      &quot;SUBJECT_NOT_PRESENT&quot;&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;escalate_after_attempts&quot;: 5&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"retry_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"base_delay_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"factor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"max_delay_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3600000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"jitter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"full\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"max_attempts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"non_retryable_codes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"WORM_OBJECT_PROTECTED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"LEGAL_HOLD_ACTIVE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"PERMISSION_DENIED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"SCHEMA_MISMATCH\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"SUBJECT_NOT_PRESENT\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"escalate_after_attempts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>指数退避加<strong>抖动</strong>是必需的：几十个执行器同时对一个刚恢复的下游重试，会把下游再次打垮（惊群）。<code>jitter: full</code> 指延迟在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>delay</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, \\text{delay}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">delay</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 区间随机取值，比固定退避更能错开峰值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"对账扫描\">对账扫描</h3><p>重试只能处理「我们知道失败了」的情况。真正危险的是<strong>沉默的失败</strong>：执行器发出请求、下游执行了、但回执在网络上丢了。此时平台认为任务失败，实际下游已经删除。重试会因为幂等而安全（下游返回 <code>not_found</code>），但如果不重试，任务会永远停留在 <code>failed</code>。</p>\n<p>对账扫描是兜底：定期把各系统侧的<strong>实际状态</strong>与平台记录的状态比对，找出偏差。实现方式各系统不同——关系库可查行数、搜索索引可查文档、对象存储可查对象存在性——但都需要一个 <code>read_back</code> 探针。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 找出「平台认为未完成、但复核显示已不存在」的任务，直接收敛&#10;SELECT t.task_id, t.system_key&#10;FROM dsr_delete_task t&#10;WHERE t.state IN (&#39;failed&#39;,&#39;escalated&#39;)&#10;  AND t.updated_at &lt; now() - interval &#39;24 hours&#39;&#10;  AND NOT EXISTS (&#10;    SELECT 1 FROM dsr_verification v&#10;    WHERE v.task_id = t.task_id AND v.still_present&#10;  );\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 找出「平台认为未完成、但复核显示已不存在」的任务，直接收敛</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">task_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">system_key</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dsr_delete_task t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'failed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'escalated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">updated_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'24 hours'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dsr_verification v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">task_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">task_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">still_present</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对账的价值不止于收敛状态，它还是<strong>删除声明可信度的来源</strong>：平台能说「我们检查过，确实查不到了」，而不是「我们的执行器说它删了」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编排的边界与终止\">编排的边界与终止</h2><p>删除请求不是无限重试的。它有一个不可逾越的上界——<strong>法定时限</strong>（见 <a href=\"../dsr-sla-audit/dsr-deadline-sla-workflow\">SLA 计时</a>）。当剩余时间不足以完成剩余任务时，编排必须改变策略：不是继续重试，而是<strong>转入例外</strong>（把无法删除的部分按<a href=\"anonymize-vs-delete-choice\">匿名化或例外</a>处理）并对当事人如实告知。</p>\n<p>因此编排器需要一条与计时器联动的规则：当 <code>deadline_at - now()</code> 小于某个阈值时，把所有仍处非终态的任务从「重试」降级为「转例外」，并在答复中说明。这比逾期不回复要好得多，也比声称「已全部删除」诚实得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>删除不做分布式事务，做可对账的最终一致；状态机加对账扫描是骨架。</li>\n<li>执行器抽象让各系统的删除语义归一为 <code>outcome</code>；<code>not_found</code> 是成功而非失败。</li>\n<li>幂等键必须包含 <code>request_id</code> 与 <code>entity_scope_hash</code>，并靠数据库唯一约束兜住重复。</li>\n<li>部分失败按原因分档重试而非按系统；指数退避必须加抖动以避免惊群。</li>\n<li>沉默失败靠对账扫描兜底，对账也是删除声明可信度的来源。</li>\n<li>编排必须与<a href=\"../dsr-sla-audit/dsr-deadline-sla-workflow\">法定时限</a>联动，时间不足时转<a href=\"anonymize-vs-delete-choice\">例外处理</a>而非无限重试。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨系统删除级联编排","id":"跨系统删除级联编排"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"执行器抽象","id":"执行器抽象"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等键的构造","id":"幂等键的构造"},{"level":2,"text":"编排的持久化模型","id":"编排的持久化模型"},{"level":2,"text":"部分失败的处理策略","id":"部分失败的处理策略"},{"level":3,"text":"可重试与不可重试","id":"可重试与不可重试"},{"level":3,"text":"对账扫描","id":"对账扫描"},{"level":2,"text":"编排的边界与终止","id":"编排的边界与终止"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"法定保留例外范围","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/data-subject-rights-fulfillment/cross-system-data-locate/legal-hold-exception-scope"},"next":{"title":"匿名化与删除的选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/data-subject-rights-fulfillment/cascade-delete-anonymize/anonymize-vs-delete-choice"}}